01:31.041 --> 01:36.510
There's no escape, no way to flee.

01:41.594 --> 01:46.135
And now the screaming finally starts Tearing

01:46.495 --> 01:50.856
all my seams apart It's all my fault, this whole

01:50.936 --> 01:55.937
